flowchart LR
  EMAIL[Shared finance mailbox] --> GRAPH[Microsoft Graph adapter]
  UPLOAD[Unified document API] --> DOC[Source hash + canonical processor]
  GRAPH --> DOC
  DOC --> CLASS[Deterministic AP / AR classifier]
  CLASS -->|AP invoice| ORCH[Parent LangGraph orchestrator]
  CLASS -->|AR remittance| ORCH
  CLASS -->|ambiguous| HUMAN[Unified exception desk]
  ORCH --> AP[AP subgraph: policy + 2/3-way match]
  ORCH --> AR[AR subgraph: policy + open-item allocation]
  POLICY[(Policies + pgvector)] --> LLAMA[LlamaIndex retrieval]
  LLAMA --> AP
  LLAMA --> AR
  AP -->|clean| PJ[Payment Journal]
  AR -->|clean| CASH[Cash application]
  AP -->|exception| HUMAN
  AR -->|exception| HUMAN
  HUMAN -->|correct / approved policy path| AP
  HUMAN -->|correct + rematch| AR
  ERPAPI[HTTP Mock ERP API] -->|PO + GR| AP
  ERPAPI -->|open AR items| AR
  PJ --> ERPAPI
  CASH --> ERPAPI
  DOC --> AUDIT[(Hash-chained audit + durable workflow state)]
  ORCH --> AUDIT
  AP --> AUDIT
  AR --> AUDIT
  HUMAN --> AUDIT
  ORCH -. traces .-> PHOENIX[Arize Phoenix]
